{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108250","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108250","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1110825001:1":{"text":"Dura above, I never thought I'd be free again!","source_cn":"艾雅在上，没想到我们能这么快重获自由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA108539396C12E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110825002:1":{"text":"The Maulers aren't here...","source_cn":"……这里没有蛮血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13FE570712DDDF05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110825003:1":{"text":"Where are they?","source_cn":"他们人呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x093F96E09ECD562B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110825004:1":{"text":"The Maulers who were also captured have already been transported.","source_cn":"蛮血……和我们一起被抓来的蛮血，都被提前转运走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3952F15A2EB16B80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110825005:1":{"text":"The Quicksand Claws said that the Maulers are a tough bunch, with more stamina and strength than us, so they should be sent to \"where they belong\" quickly.","source_cn":"流沙之爪说，蛮血反抗心强，体力和力量都比我们好，应该尽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0DC2180EB4C63C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1110825005":{"text":"The Quicksand Claws said that the Maulers are a tough bunch, with more stamina and strength than us, so they should be sent to \"where they belong\" quickly.","source_cn":"流沙之爪说，蛮血反抗心强，体力和力量都比我们好，应该尽早送去“该去的地方”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0DC2180EB4C63C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110825006:1":{"text":"I don't know... If you had arrived a few hours later, we would have been taken away too!","source_cn":"不知道……你们要是再迟来几小时，我们也会被带走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA14CF9930A215F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110825007:1":{"text":"From what I gathered from those Quicksand Claws, they want to force the Maulers and us to do hard labor.","source_cn":"我听刚才那些流沙之爪的意思，是要强迫蛮血和我们干力气活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA48A98F1397D337C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110825008:1":{"text":"As long as they play by the Quicksand Claws' rules, they should be okay... Just doing manual labor shouldn't put them in immediate danger.","source_cn":"只是干苦力的话，应该暂时不会有危险……只要不忤逆流沙之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D0EA9B7B8116696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110825009:1":{"text":"They're from the Uru Clan, they'll fight till the end.","source_cn":"他们是乌尔氏族的人，会抗争到底。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA37685675F41081F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110825010:1":{"text":"We need to find them as soon as possible.","source_cn":"我们得尽快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x092C878B78AB9859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110825011:1":{"text":"Let's get these people back to their caravans first, they don't look so well.","source_cn":"先把这些人送回商队吧，他们看起来状态不太好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20A49CDDC703DED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110825012:1":{"text":"Of course.","source_cn":"好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2839CC05014FE4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"Where were they sent to?","source_cn":"他们被送去哪里了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x86AE2B0A58BDBE52","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Where were they sent to?","female":"Where were they sent to?","variant_male_record_index":"63662","variant_female_record_index":"63663","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"Will they be safe?!","source_cn":"不会有生命危险吧？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F202B0514DDF6CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Will they be safe?!","female":"Will they be safe?!","variant_male_record_index":"63664","variant_female_record_index":"63665","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:劳工安德斯":{"text":"Andy","source":"劳工安德斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:劳工瓦伦汀":{"text":"Valentin","source":"劳工瓦伦汀","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":4}}